# Building an object runs its constructor, not its methods: `Store("data/store.txt")` writes and reads nothing, and the
# route prints the path the store holds.

route storebuild.run
step run/Store()

line entry > run call
line run/Store() > Store·store@run/Store() value
line Store·store@run/Store() > run value   # run prints a field of the store it built
line run > Screen own

home Store·store@run/Store() run

side entry left
side Screen right
